        "tokens": "Q2: Employee IDs of team members who provided insights on strengths and weaknesses of PersonalizeForce's competitor products. eid_5318af37 (George Williams) - shared TailorAI strengths (dynamic content personalization, social media integration, real-time ML models, A/B testing) and SmartSuggest weaknesses (real-time update issues, limited language support, privacy concerns). eid_fce6544f (Charlie Brown) - shared PersonaAI weaknesses (high setup cost, complex integration, limited niche support, significant data requirements). eid_c9c3d8d5 (Julia Martinez) - shared SmartSuggest strengths (AI-powered recommendation engine, real-time feedback adaptation, customizable algorithms, multi-channel support, analytics dashboard). eid_d2f0f99a (David Davis) - shared PersonaAI strengths (real-time behavior analysis, CRM integration, advanced segmentation, predictive analytics) and weaknesses (data quality reliance, limited niche platform coverage). eid_a253c65a (Hannah Brown) - shared TailorAI weaknesses (steep learning curve, unintuitive interface, engagement drop-off, accuracy issues for new users, third-party data dependency). eid_b6a30126 (Charlie Martinez) - identified SmartSuggest weakness (customizable algorithms as double-edged sword, complexity for non-technical businesses)."
